{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Gymini 是一款隨身健身教練 App，適合在家、出差或健身室隨時想動一動的人。只要告知可用的時間、想做的類型與手邊器材，它便會即時編排訓練並以語音逐步指導，讓你放下手機專心運動。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-185.webp\">\n<h2>離線無網絡也能照常訓練</h2>\n<p>Gymini 內置 178 個動作與 73 套訓練，涵蓋力量、伸展、活動度與呼吸，每個動作均有逐步說明與關鍵提示，需要器材的動作也附有免器材版本。你只需選擇 2、5 或 10 分鐘，內容全部離線可用，在飛機、沒有訊號的健身室同樣照常運作，不會傳送或收集任何資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-35-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-36-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-37-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-38-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-39-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-40-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Gymini: Quick Workouts</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:39:40.538077+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:29:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T20:37:39.705777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:38:23.127814+00:00","content_hash":"23c6c297187ff4ad48407c7d0a0b6e0d10b9b2d6997dfea2b20140021731f058","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}